+The generation command verifies the official release archive before reading it,
+checks the release package and public entrypoint identities, builds the exact tagged
+workspace dependency graph, and rejects the candidate unless the adapter and legal
+digests above match. Runtime support additionally requires the native activation
+profile, sidecar resource closure, compatibility inventory, and focused tests to
+agree with these bytes.
